{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-8-4","kind":"proposition","title":"构造与求解：最小公倍数与连比例与比例","englishTitle":"Given as many ratios as we please in least numbers, to find numbers in continued proportion which are the least in the given ratios.","book":8,"number":4,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:8.prop.4","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:8.prop.4/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":4,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-8-4@raw-74ce87c5bb135112","contentId":"euclid-8-4","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"74ce87c5bb13511285fbfddfe7d3becbf33b2f0f86a5ded15a86987553183dde","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-8-4.statement","euclid-8-4.construction.1","euclid-8-4.construction.2","euclid-8-4.proof.1","euclid-8-4.proof.2","euclid-8-4.proof.3","euclid-8-4.proof.4","euclid-8-4.proof.5","euclid-8-4.proof.6","euclid-8-4.proof.7","euclid-8-4.proof.8","euclid-8-4.proof.9","euclid-8-4.proof.10","euclid-8-4.proof.11","euclid-8-4.proof.12","euclid-8-4.proof.13","euclid-8-4.construction.3","euclid-8-4.proof.14","euclid-8-4.proof.15","euclid-8-4.proof.16","euclid-8-4.proof.17","euclid-8-4.proof.18","euclid-8-4.proof.19","euclid-8-4.proof.20","euclid-8-4.construction.4","euclid-8-4.proof.21","euclid-8-4.proof.22","euclid-8-4.proof.23","euclid-8-4.proof.24","euclid-8-4.proof.25","euclid-8-4.proof.26","euclid-8-4.proof.27","euclid-8-4.proof.28","euclid-8-4.conclusion","euclid-8-4.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-8-4.statement","contentId":"euclid-8-4","revisionId":"euclid-8-4@raw-74ce87c5bb135112","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1ddcb344b7c766a1834e35c10aabf929bb7d9ce067d937ef44200c4cabda4bda","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Given as many ratios as we please in least numbers, to find numbers in continued proportion which are the least in the given ratios."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"考虑到我们所希望的最少数字,连比例中的数字在给定比中最少。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-4.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-8-4","revisionId":"euclid-8-4@raw-74ce87c5bb135112","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c45d7a3ed49d53a3067eaa3dd9aadca660525aa7e942c4a6e3f28c2b9b34dea3","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let the given ratios in least numbers be that of A to B, that of C to D, and that of E to F; thus it is required to find numbers in continued proportion which are the least that are in the ratio of A to B, in the ratio of C to D, and in the ratio of E to F."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"最低比例为A-B,C-D,E-F;因此,需要发现连比例中的数字,其中最低比例为A-B,C-D,E-F。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-4.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-8-4","revisionId":"euclid-8-4@raw-74ce87c5bb135112","order":2,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4f2d8a0c05bf1691020427717714160fc4902dba158e910b99a078e9d428c6e4","citations":["euclid-7-34"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let G, the least number measured by B, C, be taken. [[VII. 34](/principles/euclid-7-34)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"G,最少的B,C [[VII. 34](/principles/euclid-7-34)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-4.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-8-4","revisionId":"euclid-8-4@raw-74ce87c5bb135112","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f8d6561342e5b1e9574961811777288a36efe65835af34a0aee7176d0c5d1a9f","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, as many times as B measures G, so many times also let A measure H, and, as many times as C measures G, so many times also let D measure K."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"B 整除 G次 A 整除 H次 C 整除 G次 D 整除 K次"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-4.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-8-4","revisionId":"euclid-8-4@raw-74ce87c5bb135112","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4fb0069c05f55ab7f3e5e8bbc8ce60bbe64274bd618cd866b56b8632c15a533d","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now E either measures or does not measure K."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在E,或者整除,或者不是整除,K。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-4.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-8-4","revisionId":"euclid-8-4@raw-74ce87c5bb135112","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"417172124a383d5eb40b139503383efeb7cf5d197da3c58bd3e953cd3ad77efa","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"First, let it measure it."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"首先,让它整除它。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-4.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-8-4","revisionId":"euclid-8-4@raw-74ce87c5bb135112","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9e42bafb9ac0649e989e62c23f66fabecd4aa5668b18f504c469eca3d7cb3922","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, as many times as E measures K, so many times let F measure L also."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"E 整除 K倍 F 整除 L倍"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-4.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-8-4","revisionId":"euclid-8-4@raw-74ce87c5bb135112","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"99079a414e471e7279addc2604d5432c4516bb866f6d0d879e9713ce9a930c18","citations":["euclid-7-def-20"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now, since A measures H the same number of times that B measures G, therefore, as A is to B, so is H to G. [[VII. Def. 20, VII. 13](/principles/euclid-7-def-20)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在,A 整除 H 与B 整除 G 的倍数相同,因此,A B B B 的比值等于 H G ；A 与 B 之比等于 H 与 G 之比。 [[VII. Def. 20, VII. 13](/principles/euclid-7-def-20)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-4.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-8-4","revisionId":"euclid-8-4@raw-74ce87c5bb135112","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f4bd41886489f9dbfdaac88fec7a4c899371cea0253d1bc9192c64ff4cc0a179","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For the same reason also, as C is to D, so is G to K, and further, as E is to F, so is K to L; therefore H, G, K, L are continuously proportional in the ratio of A to B, in the ratio of C to D, and in the ratio of E to F."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"出于同样的原因,C对D的比等于G对K的比,E对F的比等于K对L的比;因此,H、G、K、L的比是A对B的比,C对D的比是C对D的比,E对F的比是E对F的比；C 与 D 之比等于 G 与 K 之比；E 与 F 之比等于 K 与 L 之比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-4.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-8-4","revisionId":"euclid-8-4@raw-74ce87c5bb135112","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4ed9d03ff9d0b773587f09f09a243fd5b231cc406e9e3614db9d07cf09a73249","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"I say next that they are also the least that have this property."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"接下来我说,它们也是拥有这种财产的最小者。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-4.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-8-4","revisionId":"euclid-8-4@raw-74ce87c5bb135112","order":10,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a2949c24f4aef86b42d46198e2c2ac144d92ec13dbb6df3ed4beb879affee99d","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, if H, G, K, L are not the least numbers continuously proportional in the ratios of A to B, of C to D, and of E to F, let them be N, O, M, P."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果H、G、K、L不是连续的成比例,即A与B、C与D的比和E与F的比,那么,N、O、M、P与P的比是最少的成比例。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-4.proof.9","contentId":"euclid-8-4","revisionId":"euclid-8-4@raw-74ce87c5bb135112","order":11,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 9","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9789ac61345b71c7b53e3c793a3cbf2865243ba3ed2a80f0d1800a3db926b59f","citations":["euclid-7-20"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Then since, as A is to B, so is N to O, while A, B are least, and the least numbers measure those which have the same ratio the same number of times, the greater the greater and the less the less, that is, the antecedent the antecedent and the consequent the consequent; therefore B measures O. [[VII. 20](/principles/euclid-7-20)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"之后,A-B的比等于N-O的比,而A-B的比最小,而同样比的最少整除的数字等于相同次数,数量越大,数量越小,数量越小,即,前身和后果,因此,B 整除 O的数字等于前身；A 与 B 之比等于 N 与 O 之比。 [[VII. 20](/principles/euclid-7-20)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-4.proof.10","contentId":"euclid-8-4","revisionId":"euclid-8-4@raw-74ce87c5bb135112","order":12,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 10","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"cce9c86e0272b11f040a941b4149dd41250615a6151a603ab5a8e3e51222a09e","citations":["euclid-7-35"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For the same reason C also measures O; therefore B, C measure O; therefore the least number measured by B, C will also measure O. [[VII. 35](/principles/euclid-7-35)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"出于同样原因,C也是整除 O;因此,B、C 整除 O;因此,以B整除的最低数字也是整除 O。 [[VII. 35](/principles/euclid-7-35)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-4.proof.11","contentId":"euclid-8-4","revisionId":"euclid-8-4@raw-74ce87c5bb135112","order":13,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 11","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a35e449d2cb386577c21d288e77e567a750b73d5da92ed0661b5bbe2bd3d51f4","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But G is the least number measured by B, C; therefore G measures O, the greater the less: which is impossible."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但G是B,C的最小数字,因此,G,整除,O,数量越大,数量就越小:这是不可能的。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-4.proof.12","contentId":"euclid-8-4","revisionId":"euclid-8-4@raw-74ce87c5bb135112","order":14,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 12","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"bb3d3e61c5fcf8a7f6751b066c10c417d4361a70bb1351745c0cb22870f0b14b","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore there will be no numbers less than H, G, K, L which are continuously in the ratio of A to B, of C to D, and of E to F."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,人数将不少于H,G,K,L,其比持续为A至B,C至D,E至F。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-4.proof.13","contentId":"euclid-8-4","revisionId":"euclid-8-4@raw-74ce87c5bb135112","order":15,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 13","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"cf2ad71f6d1c6d02277e5416e82c90b3f94702345125b026a87e5e4c2b8f7426","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Next, let E not measure K."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"接下来,让E不要整除 K。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-4.construction.3","contentId":"euclid-8-4","revisionId":"euclid-8-4@raw-74ce87c5bb135112","order":16,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4169713a0021146b28ce714542cf84168aa3aa7ba6876dbda3b6c4bdfbad5577","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let M, the least number measured by E, K, be taken."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"M,最少的E,K"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-4.proof.14","contentId":"euclid-8-4","revisionId":"euclid-8-4@raw-74ce87c5bb135112","order":17,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 14","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3ee56eeff075c47fdb688829ccf227ce2a953b258a94498b74a5ab80d0e64a6f","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, as many times as K measures M, so many times let H, G measure N, O respectively, and, as many times as E measures M, so many times let F measure P also."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"还有 K 整除 M乘以多少倍H,G,整除,N,O和,多达E 整除 M倍这么多次了 F 整除 P也给了。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-4.proof.15","contentId":"euclid-8-4","revisionId":"euclid-8-4@raw-74ce87c5bb135112","order":18,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 15","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8769c7eb080034252bd00af795e30c523b8939f0d5075e67f6f3238405b65309","citations":["euclid-7-13"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Since H measures N the same number of times that G measures O, therefore, as H is to G, so is N to O. [[VII. 13 and Def. 20](/principles/euclid-7-13)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,自H 整除 N以来,H对G 整除 O的比是G 整除 O的两倍,而H对G的比等于N对O的比；H 与 G 之比等于 N 与 O 之比。 [[VII. 13 and Def. 20](/principles/euclid-7-13)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-4.proof.16","contentId":"euclid-8-4","revisionId":"euclid-8-4@raw-74ce87c5bb135112","order":19,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 16","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d3445b55034747d79360e4cbb0ac0186fb310727ea15391960169f5bbec0128e","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, as H is to G, so is A to B; therefore also, as A is to B, so is N to O."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,H对G的比等于A对B的比;因此,A对B的比等于N对O的比；H 与 G 之比等于 A 与 B 之比；A 与 B 之比等于 N 与 O 之比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-4.proof.17","contentId":"euclid-8-4","revisionId":"euclid-8-4@raw-74ce87c5bb135112","order":20,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 17","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"989c31385ae4aa40e23a232b2cee71bbeb6d84bb4d1be212efd2ab19660751d0","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For the same reason also, as C is to D, so is O to M."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"出于同样的原因,C比D的比例等于O比M；C 与 D 之比等于 O 与 M 之比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-4.proof.18","contentId":"euclid-8-4","revisionId":"euclid-8-4@raw-74ce87c5bb135112","order":21,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 18","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f48a9a7a29f7df35892896f10b52f2a357f83ef1d0b2f76cb2a6ead3f209b780","citations":["euclid-7-13"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Again, since E measures M the same number of times that F measures P, therefore, as E is to F, so is M to P; [[VII. 13 and Def. 20](/principles/euclid-7-13)] therefore N, O, M, P are continuously proportional in the ratios of A to B, of C to D, and of E to F."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,自E 整除 M M M P次,即E F F F次,等于M P次;因此,N O M P次,即A B次、C D次和E F次,持续为成比例 330人次；E 与 F 之比等于 M 与 P 之比。 [[VII. 13 and Def. 20](/principles/euclid-7-13)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-4.proof.19","contentId":"euclid-8-4","revisionId":"euclid-8-4@raw-74ce87c5bb135112","order":22,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 19","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0d1b24675b117261c34dd74259beec5241dfcf9071779093864c8df17baaa52d","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"I say next that they are also the least that are in the ratios A : B, C : D, E : F."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"下面我说,在A:B:C:D:E:F的比中,妇女也是最低的。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-4.proof.20","contentId":"euclid-8-4","revisionId":"euclid-8-4@raw-74ce87c5bb135112","order":23,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 20","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"feca83dcca88193342c53756604f94f37a17797c451fbc8832001346f04b8f0e","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, if not, there will be some numbers less than N, O, M, P continuously proportional in the ratios A : B, C : D, E : F."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"否则,在A:B,C:D,E:F的比中,将有不到N,O,M,P连续成比例。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-4.construction.4","contentId":"euclid-8-4","revisionId":"euclid-8-4@raw-74ce87c5bb135112","order":24,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ba94f76d51dda05f2032c9af32fd900465f67b657896f1ac40d5ccdb691197bb","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let them be Q, R, S, T."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让它们Q,R,S,T"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-4.proof.21","contentId":"euclid-8-4","revisionId":"euclid-8-4@raw-74ce87c5bb135112","order":25,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 21","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a2801f9f472f42df41c50a5d44d69bc9fe2ff30618549887f49deb85232b6341","citations":["euclid-7-20"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now since, as Q is to R, so is A to B, while A, B are least, and the least numbers measure those which have the same ratio with them the same number of times, the antecedent the antecedent and the consequent the consequent, [[VII. 20](/principles/euclid-7-20)] therefore B measures R."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"从此以后,Q比R等于A比B,而A比B,最少,而与它们相同比的最少整除,比前身和随之而来的比分别为B,整除,R；Q 与 R 之比等于 A 与 B 之比。 [[VII. 20](/principles/euclid-7-20)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-4.proof.22","contentId":"euclid-8-4","revisionId":"euclid-8-4@raw-74ce87c5bb135112","order":26,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 22","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3c3e896b67fc2a99452369d0dac3dd9cfca74c07e3a99a6e76973424055c5c23","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For the same reason C also measures R; therefore B, C measure R."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"出于同样原因,C也是整除 R;因此,B、C 整除 R。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-4.proof.23","contentId":"euclid-8-4","revisionId":"euclid-8-4@raw-74ce87c5bb135112","order":27,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 23","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e6081f2dfc6c45806464c9803ecaaaaf4286dddc40478c3042a32862a6bb01fe","citations":["euclid-7-35"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore the least number measured by B, C will also measure R. [[VII. 35](/principles/euclid-7-35)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,以B、C为标准的最低数字也将是整除、R。 [[VII. 35](/principles/euclid-7-35)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-4.proof.24","contentId":"euclid-8-4","revisionId":"euclid-8-4@raw-74ce87c5bb135112","order":28,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 24","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"49b8ea8b9e8976b30d286ed3d5ce74012da49b46adb691fe97d3a09a5c238e06","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But G is the least number measured by B, C; therefore G measures R."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但G是整除为B,C的最小数字,因此是G,整除,R。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-4.proof.25","contentId":"euclid-8-4","revisionId":"euclid-8-4@raw-74ce87c5bb135112","order":29,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 25","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"07cda2c1457b4e25c1039a4104dace43fb30279e5504790aa9f82dc72a4d674f","citations":["euclid-7-13"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, as G is to R, so is K to S: [[VII. 13](/principles/euclid-7-13)] therefore K also measures S."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"G比R等于K比S,因此K也等于整除、S；G 与 R 之比等于 K 与 S 之比。 [[VII. 13](/principles/euclid-7-13)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-4.proof.26","contentId":"euclid-8-4","revisionId":"euclid-8-4@raw-74ce87c5bb135112","order":30,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 26","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ed4130e6413bf589f336324dc6e30fc144d3872485ad6434408122f659a14941","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But E also measures S; therefore E, K measure S."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但E也是整除 S,因此E,K 整除 S。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-4.proof.27","contentId":"euclid-8-4","revisionId":"euclid-8-4@raw-74ce87c5bb135112","order":31,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 27","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c98f48b93dbc7e45b225c44bacb51f89f707995cd9439647590eabb7e754a8fa","citations":["euclid-7-35"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore the least number measured by E, K will also measure S. [[VII. 35](/principles/euclid-7-35)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,以E、K为标准的最低数字也将是整除、S。 [[VII. 35](/principles/euclid-7-35)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-4.proof.28","contentId":"euclid-8-4","revisionId":"euclid-8-4@raw-74ce87c5bb135112","order":32,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 28","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9ca1da41dfb7147db5e25ab2df0f339dc16f8a08b3da62b8ac0ae4bc48446ca5","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But M is the least number measured by E, K; therefore M measures S, the greater the less: which is impossible."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但M是E,K的最小数字,因此,M,整除,S,数量越大,数量就越小:这是不可能的。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-4.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-8-4","revisionId":"euclid-8-4@raw-74ce87c5bb135112","order":33,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0ce150b9550d0033e66a5d6aedfc3ebc34fc027a0fd76e54d2e089fa3be5c8b3","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore there will not be any numbers less than N, O, M, P continuously proportional in the ratios of A to B, of C to D, and of E to F; therefore N, O, M, P are the least numbers continuously proportional in the ratios A : B, C : D, E : F. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,在A-B、C-D和E-F的比中,人数将不少于N、O、M、P和成比例;因此,N、O、M、P是A:B、C:D、E:F、E:E。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-4.source","contentId":"euclid-8-4","revisionId":"euclid-8-4@raw-74ce87c5bb135112","order":34,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c2c1a087e771dcf29cee48520ddfbebc91f7c02082454e9c3b6709161c956d01","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:8.prop.4/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:8.prop.4\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-8-4:euclid-7-34:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-8-4","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-8-4.construction.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-7-34","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:8.prop.4","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:8.prop.4/","sourceLabel":"VII. 34"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-8-4:euclid-7-def-20:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-8-4","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-8-4.proof.5"],"targetContentId":"euclid-7-def-20","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:8.prop.4","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:8.prop.4/","sourceLabel":"VII. Def. 20, VII. 13"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-8-4:euclid-7-13:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-8-4","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-8-4.proof.15","euclid-8-4.proof.18","euclid-8-4.proof.25"],"targetContentId":"euclid-7-13","type":"depends_on","provenance":{